        "label": "Lunar soft landing + Lunokhod 2 deployment — Le Monnier crater",
        "description": "1973-01-15. Landed in Le Monnier crater (26.00°N, 30.41°E). Lunokhod 2 drove 39 km over 4 lunar days — the longest distance any extraterrestrial rover travelled until the Mars Opportunity rover broke the record in 2014."
